None: Disable mesh sharing.
Auto: Automatically select Primary/Replica.
Primary: Provides particle simulation results to the same group.
Primary Simulator: Primary, but do not render the particle (simulation only).
Replica: Render simulation results provided by the primary.␀␀␀e¤␀␀N¦␀␀␀␀€ÒMesh sharing group ID.
If non-zero is specified, particle simulation results are shared within the group.␀␀␀N¦␀␀␀␀␀e¤␀␀N¦␀␀␀␀4Emission position mode.
Relative: The particles will be emitted from the scaled position.
Absolute: The particles will be emitted from the world position.␀␀␀N¦␀␀*␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀N¦␀␀e¤␀␀␀␀␀␀␀äHow to automatically adjust when the Canvas scale is changed by the screen size or reference resolution.
None: Do nothing.
